    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "David and Zion Chosen"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A song of ascents."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Lord, remember David",
          "and all the hardships he endured,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and how he swore an oath to the Lord,",
          "making a vow to the Mighty One of Jacob:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“I will not enter my house",
          "or get into my bed,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will not allow my eyes to sleep",
          "or my eyelids to slumber"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "until I find a place for the Lord,",
          "a dwelling for the Mighty One of Jacob.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We heard of the ark in Ephrathah; ,",
          "we found it in the fields of Jaar. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let’s go to his dwelling place;",
          "let’s worship at his footstool."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Rise up, Lord, come to your resting place,",
          "you and your powerful ark."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "May your priests be clothed with righteousness,",
          "and may your faithful people shout for joy."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the sake of your servant David,",
          "do not reject your anointed one. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord swore an oath to David,",
          "a promise he will not abandon:",
          "“I will set one of your offspring",
          "on your throne."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If your sons keep my covenant",
          "and my decrees that I will teach them,",
          "their sons will also sit on your throne forever.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For the Lord has chosen Zion;",
          "he has desired it for his home:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "“This is my resting place forever;",
          "I will make my home here",
          "because I have desired it."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will abundantly bless its food;",
          "I will satisfy its needy with bread."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will clothe its priests with salvation,",
          "and its faithful people will shout for joy."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "There I will make a horn grow for David;",
          "I have prepared a lamp for my anointed one."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will clothe his enemies with shame,",
          "but the crown he wears will be glorious.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
